! The `ph.x` input that generated `reference.out.ph-al-metal-nosym-offgrid`, at
! q = (0.1, 0.05, 0) in 2 pi/alat, a wavevector off the 4x4x4 grid of
! `al-metal-nosym.in`, so the k + q spheres pad to a different width than the
! k spheres. From the ground state of `al-metal-nosym.in`:
!
!   pw.x -in al-metal-nosym.in && ph.x -in al-metal-nosym.ph.in
!
! Serial QE 7.5, 2026-10-05. `outdir`, `prefix` and `fildyn` are rewritten by
! whoever regenerates it.
elph
 &inputph
  tr2_ph=1.0d-14, prefix='aloff', outdir='./tmp', fildvscf='aloffdv',
  amass(1)=26.98, fildyn='aloff.dyn', electron_phonon='simple', trans=.true.,
 /
0.1 0.05 0.0
